+return {
+  /**
+   * runs a bunch of GLSL tests using the passed in parameters
+   * The parameters are:
+   *
+   * feature:
+   *    the name of the function being tested (eg, sin, dot,
+   *    normalize)
+   *
+   * testFunc:
+   *    The prototype of function to be tested not including the
